 result←{show_pass}Run url;DoTest;F;LoadDependency;fn;r;tests
 ⎕←'Testing ',url
 show_pass←⎕VGET⊂'show_pass' 0
 ##.MOCKYT.Run
 DoTest←url∘(show_pass _Test)
 result←1
 result∧←DoTest MAIN     ⍝ General tests should pass from clean start
 InsertDummyData

 ⍝ Refresh search and recommendations cache.
 ⍝ Wait for any worker left by a refresh test, or its cache build finishes mid-run.
 {}WaitRefreshIdle 300
 ⍝ Build cache synchronously because the MOCK tests below depend on it having finished.
 #.DCMS.ADMIN.RefreshData 0

 ⍝ FIXME once RefreshData builds cache in isolate, reinstate wait til ready for tests
 ⍝:While ~#.isolate.Available'#.DCMS.QUERY.VIDEOS.recommendations'   ⍝ Wait until recommendations ready
 ⍝:EndWhile
 result∧←DoTest MOCK   ⍝ Test insert and retrieve dummy data
 result∧←DoTest MAIN   ⍝ General tests should still pass after populating database, cache etc.
 result∧←DoTest CRUD   ⍝ Test Create Read Update Delete

 result∧←DoTest REFRESH
